cused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,767][334,814]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="4" text="• A savory, plant-based alternative to scrambled eggs, rich in protein." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,840][1006,924]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="5" text="• Use firm or extra-firm tofu for the best texture; crumble it into a pan and sauté with spices." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,940][1006,1024]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="6" text="• Boost flavor and nutritional value with turmeric, black salt (kala namak), and nutritional yeast for a cheesy taste." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,1040][1006,1124]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="7" text="• Easily customize with your favorite vegetables like spinach, bell peppers, mushrooms, and onions." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.samsung.genuicraft" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[74,1140][1006,1224]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="8" text="Greek Yogurt Parfait" resource-i